      "side": 1,
      "message": "May I know what\u0027s the reason we want to avoid changing the D-Bus macro? And this change doesn\u0027t actually add too much complexity but split the original macro into 2 parts. The first half is used to generate a pre-export function (the term in this CL is `generater`) and will be grouped with other pre-export functions into an exporter, which will be used later to export the D-Bus methods.\n\nI wrote a document[1] for comparing different designs for the QA interface. Since I thought it would be a small change with a small impact, I didn\u0027t send out to broader audiences and just made the decision by myself. What you mention about putting all QA methods into the same trait is included in this document but the other one \"let QA method stay in their trait\" was not in consideration. If \"let QA method stay in their trait\" is the preferred solution, than I think we can also deprecate the D-Bus QA interface.\n\n[1] https://docs.google.com/document/d/1y51kpFU-fBtumTzNg4B-idZg7aSW8XSWXwGnF32AEDY/edit?resourcekey\u003d0-wvV5uL2cqFy5HsDABTIvqg#",
